      "content": "it's just hard to see the \"coping\" part of it. like, no matter what i do, the weight is still there. i feel like i'm just performing being a person every single day and i'm so drained. it feels like there's no point in trying to fix something that's just... broken at the core. does it ever actually get easier or is it just a constant cycle of trying to stay afloat?",
